        "description": "<p>• Underwhelming retainer: A child, criminal low-life, or horror nerd follows you around and does your bidding without a Blood Bond. Build them as a Weak mortal.</p><p>•• A ghoul, a family servant, a human lover, or a dominated thrall: give them a backstory. Build them as an Average mortal or as a ghoul with no Advantages. For more on Ghouls, see p. 234.</p><p>••• A retainer competent enough to act independently and make lesser problems go away. They are likely a ghoul with traits equivalent to Gifted mortals, on top of their supernatural abilities</p>",
