    "activeForm": "homid",
    "appearance": "<p>Olly has straight black hair, overgrown bangs, green eyes. Wears mostly black, usually sporting the camo colored backpack that carries his camera. 5' 8\", appears to be around 26 or 27. Walks/stands at the slightest odd angle due to a bone on his right leg that healed wrong. Fidgety unless he's on something that levels him out. Is used to commanding a certain level of respect (in the underground), less from charisma than because of his reputation for running his mouth and then backing it up. If you can't tell if he's joking, you kind of have to default to assuming he's serious. In retrospect, he'd say that the shocking part is that he lived long enough to become undead.</p>",
